WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:26.984
The next day Tom practiced some spells.

2
00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:34.723
He tried to make stone bricks appear.

3
00:00:34.724 --> 00:00:54.620
Poof! Cheese bricks appeared!

4
00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:57.628
The knight arrived.

5
00:00:57.629 --> 00:01:08.876
Cat hid as the knight looked around.

6
00:01:08.877 --> 00:01:13.317
"Can you turn these bricks into gold?" the knight asked.

7
00:01:13.318 --> 00:01:17.898
"This knight is greedy," Tom thought.

8
00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:22.144
"You have one free spell," Tom said.

9
00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:25.424
"Do you want some gold bricks?"

10
00:01:25.425 --> 00:01:28.929
"Hmm," the knight said.

11
00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:43.926
He walked around the lab.

12
00:01:43.927 --> 00:01:49.131
Tom saw him steal some cheese.

13
00:01:49.132 --> 00:01:54.783
"I do not like this knight," Tom thought.

14
00:01:54.784 --> 00:01:58.866
"I want to win the joust," the knight said finally.

15
00:01:58.867 --> 00:02:02.151
"I want to win the prize money.

16
00:02:02.152 --> 00:02:07.100
But my horse doesn't obey me.

17
00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:13.960
Do a spell that will make her obey me."

18
00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:17.833
The joust was a contest at the Royal Fair.

19
00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:21.841
Knights held lances and rode horses.

20
00:02:21.842 --> 00:02:28.976
They tried to knock down other knights.

21
00:02:28.977 --> 00:02:34.622
The last knight on a horse won.

22
00:02:34.623 --> 00:02:38.147
Tom frowned. "That's cheating."

23
00:02:38.148 --> 00:02:42.446
"I won the magic spell," the knight snapped.

24
00:02:42.447 --> 00:02:45.367
"You must do it, Wizard!"

25
00:02:45.368 --> 00:02:48.483
Tom frowned again.

26
00:02:48.484 --> 00:02:52.230
The knight wore a nasty grin.

27
00:02:52.231 --> 00:02:57.449
"I could sell my card to Dirk," he said.

28
00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:02.829
"He is bald, but he won the free haircut card!"

29
00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:08.222
Tom sighed. "Fine.

30
00:03:08.223 --> 00:03:12.341
Meet me at the jousting field at midnight.

31
00:03:12.342 --> 00:03:19.911
Bring your horse."
